### ==========================================================================
### 🚌 BUS ATTENDANCE MANAGEMENT SYSTEM — REST CLIENT SUITE
### VSCode REST Client Extension (`humao.rest-client`) Compatible
### Base URL: http://localhost:3001/api
### ==========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@authToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 1. Health & Setup Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Setup Status Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/setup-status
Accept: application/json

### 3. Login Admin (Sets @authToken)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tharunkumark4743@gmail.com",
  "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 4. Brevo Transactional Email: Request 6-Digit OTP Signup
# @name requestOtp
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/request-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tharun Kumar",
  "registerNumber": "24IT101",
  "email": "campusvsb4743@gmail.com",
  "phone": "+91 9876543210",
  "password": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_PASSWORD}}",
  "preferredBusId": "BUS06"
}

### 5. Brevo Transactional Email: Verify 6-Digit OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "campusvsb4743@gmail.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### 6. Brevo Transactional Email: Request Password Reset
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tharunkumark4743@gmail.com"
}

### 7. Reset Password with Cryptographic Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "example-crypto-reset-token-here",
  "newPassword": "your-new-password-here"
}

### 8. Cloudinary Media: Get Signed Upload Signature
GET {{baseUrl}}/media/signature
Accept: application/json

### 9. Admin: Get Fleet Buses Roster
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/buses
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 10. Admin: Get Pending Student Approvals
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/approvals
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. Incharge: Start Morning Attendance Session (Dynamic Rotating Code)
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/session/start
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "busId": "BUS01",
  "sessionType": "MORNING",
  "attendanceMode": "GROUND",
  "verificationMethod": "CODE_GPS",
  "latitude": 12.9716,
  "longitude": 77.5946
}

### 12. Student: Verify Boarding with Dynamic Code and Geolocation
POST {{baseUrl}}/attendance/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "582103",
  "busId": "BUS01",
  "latitude": 12.9716,
  "longitude": 77.5946,
  "accuracyMeters": 15
}
